ptr%2C%20size_t%20size%2C%20size_t%20nmemb%2C%20FILE%20*stream)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GvUUP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"MzEET\" id=\"MzEET\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ac11470\" id=\"u0ac11470\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">fwrite函数</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnsize_t%20fwrite(void%20*ptr%2C%20size_t%20size%2C%20size_t%20nmemb%2C%20FILE%20*stream)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HiGo5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"mLkcT\" id=\"mLkcT\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9419a3c9\" id=\"u9419a3c9\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">fclose函数</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cunistd.h%3E%5Cnint%20fclose(int%20fd)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H0ZuP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"XIhxV\" id=\"XIhxV\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a57187f\" id=\"u1a57187f\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">fflush函数</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uffa6e15b\" id=\"uffa6e15b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2d1d8d2a\" id=\"u2d1d8d2a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">fflush函数用于把尚未写到文件的内容立即写出。常用于确保前面操作的数据被写 入到磁盘上。fclose函数本身也包含了fflush的操作。fflush的函数原型如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20fflush(FILE%20*stream)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bfIx3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"jwEOq\" id=\"jwEOq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87d34738\" id=\"u87d34738\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">fseek函数</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20fseek(FILE%20*stream%2C%20long%20offset%2C%20int%20whence)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B34iM%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9c4b2f1a\" id=\"u9c4b2f1a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua23d28ec\" id=\"ua23d28ec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">其中的offset参数用于指定位置，whence参数则定义了offset的意义，whence的可取值如下：</span></p><ul list=\"u4757d571\"><li fid=\"u32593643\" data-lake-id=\"u33388f46\" id=\"u33388f46\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0320494\" id=\"ub0320494\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">SEEK_SET：offset是一个绝对位置。</span></li><li fid=\"u32593643\" data-lake-id=\"u3f0cc9e4\" id=\"u3f0cc9e4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8307bfb4\" id=\"u8307bfb4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">SEEK_END：offset是以文件尾为参考点的相对位置。</span></li><li fid=\"u32593643\" data-lake-id=\"u48a6a600\" id=\"u48a6a600\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75e969da\" id=\"u75e969da\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">SEEK_CUR：offset是以当前位置为参考点的相对位置。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ud0d87a55\" id=\"ud0d87a55\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"gFb3V\" id=\"gFb3V\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03b30bca\" id=\"u03b30bca\">案例</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstring.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%E8%A6%81%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%5Cnconst%20char%20buf%5B%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22filesystem_test%3AHello%20World!%5C%5Cn%5C%22%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E6%8F%8F%E8%BF%B0%E7%AC%A6%5CnFILE%20*fp%3B%5Cnchar%20str%5B100%5D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%20%20%20%20fp%20%3D%20fopen(%5C%22filesystem_test.txt%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22w%2B%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9ENULL%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(NULL%20%3D%3D%20fp)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22Fail%20to%20Open%20File%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E5%B0%86buf%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E5%86%99%E5%85%A51%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E8%8A%82%EF%BC%8C%E6%80%BB%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E7%94%B1strlen%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%5Cn%20%20%20%20fwrite(buf%2C%201%2C%20strlen(buf)%2C%20fp)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5Embedfire%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E5%86%99%E5%85%A51%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E8%8A%82%EF%BC%8C%E6%80%BB%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E7%94%B1strlen%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%5Cn%20%20%20%20fwrite(%5C%22Embedfire%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%201%2C%20strlen(%5C%22Embedfire%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%2Cfp)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E6%8A%8A%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%20%20%20%20fflush(fp)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E4%BD%8D%E4%BA%8E%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E5%B0%BE%E5%A4%84%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8fseek%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%BD%BF%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E5%9B%9E%E5%88%B0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B4%5Cn%20%20%20%20fseek(fp%2C%200%2C%20SEEK_SET)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E4%BB%8E%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%88%B0str%E4%B8%AD%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96100%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E8%8A%82%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%961%E6%AC%A1%5Cn%20%20%20%20fread(str%2C%20100%2C%201%2C%20fp)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%2